<title>UK: SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN SCOTTISH PREMIER DIVISION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN SCOTTISH PREMIER DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1996-12-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the Scottish</p>
<p>premier division after Saturday's matches:</p>
<p>10 - Billy Dodds (Aberdeen), Paul Gascoigne (Rangers), Pierre</p>
<p>Van Hooydonk (Celtic)</p>
<p>9 - Darren Jackson (Hibernian)</p>
<p>8 - Ally McCoist (Rangers)</p>
<p>7 - Dean Windass (Aberdeen), Keith Wright (Kilmarnock), Brian</p>
<p>Laudrup (Rangers)</p>
<p>6 - Colin Cameron (Hearts), Andreas Thom (Celtic)</p>
